    "body": "This was a design flaw of the `properties` framework. This will be addressed as part of 0.5. It is blocked by:\r\n- merging of the `SparseLabelOp` (#731)\r\n- rewrite of the `FermionicOp` as a subclass of the `SparseLabelOp` (in progress by myself, PR coming soon)\r\n- merging of the `PolynomialTensor` (#756)\r\n- implementing #666 (will be part of the aforementioned PR which I am working on)\r\n\r\nOnce all of the above is done, all of the existing classes in `qiskit_nature.second_q.properties` which build out a `FermionicOp` will be revisited and improved :+1:",
